<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Stun</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 15, up to 80%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast stun &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster stares into the target's eyes and utters the power word 
'Fresfren', and the target's mind stops answering for a moment: their next 
blow in a fight comes one combat round late. It is quick to cast and can 
be cast in the middle of a fight, so a sorcerer can use it again and again 
to keep a foe from striking.
</p><p>The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail; either way, 
casting it starts a fight. No free hands are needed. It is also found on 
potions, wands and scrolls. The hold spell stops a foe for longer.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Hold</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Shield</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>